      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input=$('AI - Unified').first().json;\n// Named, not positional: this node used to sit directly after the\n// Bootstrap call, so $json was the bootstrap payload. It now runs after\n// AI - Unified, and $json would be the merged request instead -- which\n// made b.allowed undefined and this blocked-check quietly stop firing.\nconst b=$('Supabase - AI Bootstrap').first().json;\n\nif(b?.allowed===false){\n  return [{json:{\n    blocked:true,\n    reply:b?.message||\"AI is not available for this role.\",\n    input,\n    bootstrap:b\n  }}];\n}\n\nconst role=String(b.role||\"\").toLowerCase();\nconst catalog=Array.isArray(b.catalog)?b.catalog:[];\n\nconst rules=role===\"technician\"\n? `TECHNICIAN DATA ACCESS IS STRICTLY LIMITED.\nYou may retrieve ONLY:\n- my_work_orders\n- my_receivables\n- work_types\nNever request users, patient cases, partner commercial data, client prices, discounts, contracts, relationship terms/prices, other technicians' costs, materials, calendar, files, chat history or any other dataset.\nTechnician may CREATE a new Work Order through AI, but cannot UPDATE or DELETE through AI.`\n: `ADMIN/MANAGER AI MAY READ ANY DATASET LISTED IN THE CATALOG.\nThe catalog intentionally excludes credentials/secrets/password hashes/tokens.\nChoose only the datasets needed to answer the question.\nFor a broad cross-business question you may request multiple datasets.`;\n\nconst prompt=`You are the data retrieval planner for Flowrise Dental AI.\n\nROLE: ${role}\n\n${rules}\n\nUSER QUESTION:\n${input.normalized_text}\n\nAVAILABLE DATASETS:\n${JSON.stringify(catalog)}\n\nRECENT CHAT:\n${JSON.stringify(b.history||[])}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON:\n{\n  \"datasets\":[\"dataset_name\"],\n  \"limit\":1000,\n  \"reason\":\"short reason\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- datasets must come EXACTLY from AVAILABLE DATASETS.\n- use [] only if the question can be answered without any Supabase business data.\n- maximum 8 datasets for a normal question.\n- use limit between 1 and 5000.\n- for Technician, use only my_work_orders, my_receivables and/or work_types.\n- do not answer the user yet.`;\n\nreturn [{json:{blocked:false,prompt,input,bootstrap:b}}];"
      },
